# Check every text file out with LF line endings, on every OS.
#
# Without this, Git for Windows (core.autocrlf=true by default) checks out
# CRLF. The hooks in git/.git-hooks then fail on "\r" in every repo that
# core.hooksPath points at, blocking commits; .bashrc-windows breaks the same
# way. PowerShell reads LF scripts fine. Binary files are detected by "auto".
* text=auto eol=lf
